---
name: "About Us"
title: "Genetic diagnostics company in Hyderabad | Lightening Lives"
description: "Lightening Lives LLP develops REASSURED genetic tests. Founded by Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak, formerly Chief Scientist at CSIR-CCMB, and Nidhi Chandak."
label: About
kicker: "About Lightening Lives LLP"
openingStacked: true
h1: 'The scientists, clinicians and mission <span class="h-mark">behind the tests.</span>'
lead: "Lightening Lives is a Hyderabad-based healthcare technology company, developing REASSURED genetic tests and healthcare solutions for rare genetic disorders, with a focus on haemoglobinopathies and musculopathies."
leadLine: "Established in September 2023, on the principle that every life matters."
proof:
  - { icon: "microscope", text: "25+ years of research in human genetics" }
  - { icon: "landmark", text: "Made in India, on CSIR-CCMB know-how" }
  - { icon: "badge-check", text: "ICMR approved" }
  - { icon: "award", text: "Patents granted in India and Japan" }
closing:
  h2: 'Work with us. <span class="h-mark">Most of our impact begins as a collaboration.</span>'
  body: "Tell us the condition you need to test for, your institution type, and where the testing will happen."
  solid: { text: "Partner with us", href: "/partner-with-us/" }
  line: { text: "Contact our team", href: "/contact/" }
---
{#- About (content file 5.8; people first since 25 October 2026; since the client review of 27 October
    2026, plan 2026-11-05 Task 7): the stacked opening with the company's introduction; THE FOUNDERS,
    two blocks each with a portrait of its own (stand-in crops of the founders' photograph until the
    client sends single portraits); the leadership; the team in its two groups; the patron and the
    advisory board, each with what they bring on the card; the mission; the company at a glance. A bio
    is never on the page itself: a card with one opens it in a side panel, a native popover (the browser
    opens and closes it, no script; Escape or a click outside closes it). A person without an approved
    bio has a card that does not open. Each person keeps their slug as an anchor, which the old team
    addresses forward to. No Mr., Mrs. or Ms. before a name (Dr. and Prof. stay). -#}
{%- from "picture.njk" import picture with context %}

{#- A person's bio in its side panel. -#}
{%- macro bioPanel(p) -%}
<div class="bio-panel" id="bio-{{ p.slug }}" popover role="dialog" aria-labelledby="bio-{{ p.slug }}-h">
  <button type="button" class="bio-close" popovertarget="bio-{{ p.slug }}" popovertargetaction="hide" aria-label="Close">{% icon "x" %}</button>
  {{ picture("person-" + p.slug, p.name, "12rem", { class: "bio-photo" }) }}
  <div class="bio-body">
    <h3 id="bio-{{ p.slug }}-h" class="bio-name">{{ p.name }}{% if p.credentials %} <span>{{ p.credentials }}</span>{% endif %}</h3>
    <p class="bio-role">{{ p.role }}</p>
    {%- for para in p.bio | paragraphs %}
    <p>{{ para }}</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
{%- endmacro %}

{#- A person's card: the portrait (or their initials, until a photograph arrives) on a pale ground, the
    name and role on a light panel under it, and what they bring where the card says it. The whole card
    opens the bio where there is one. -#}
{%- macro card(p, sizes) -%}
<li id="{{ p.slug }}" class="tcard">
  {%- set inner %}
    <span class="tcard-pic">{% if p.photo %}{{ picture("person-" + p.slug, p.name, sizes or "(min-width: 72rem) 17rem, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 46vw", { class: "tcard-photo" }) }}{% else %}<span class="tcard-initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.initials }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
    <span class="tcard-text">
      <span class="tcard-name">{{ p.name }}</span>
      <span class="tcard-role">{{ p.role }}</span>
      {%- if p.line %}<span class="tcard-line">{{ p.line }}</span>{% endif %}
    </span>
    {%- if p.bio %}<span class="tcard-open" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "plus" %}</span>{% endif %}
  {%- endset %}
  {%- if p.bio %}
  <button type="button" class="tcard-face" popovertarget="bio-{{ p.slug }}">{{ inner | safe }}</button>
  {{- bioPanel(p) }}
  {%- else %}
  <div class="tcard-face">{{ inner | safe }}</div>
  {%- endif %}
</li>
{%- endmacro %}

{%- set ff = team.founders[0] %}

  <!-- 1. The founders: one after the other, each a row with its own portrait -->
  <section id="founders" class="section on-mist founders-band" aria-labelledby="founders-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="founders-h" class="founders-h">The founders</h2>
      <div class="founders">
        {%- for p in team.founders %}
        {%- set story = "His story" if loop.first else "Her story" %}
        <article class="founder" id="{{ p.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ p.slug }}-h">
          {{ picture("person-" + p.slug, p.name, "(min-width: 64rem) 11rem, (min-width: 40rem) 9rem, 7rem", { class: "founder-photo" }) }}
          <div class="founder-main">
            <h3 id="{{ p.slug }}-h" class="founder-name">{{ p.name }}{% if p.credentials %} <span class="founder-cred">{{ p.credentials }}</span>{% endif %}</h3>
            <p class="founder-role">{{ p.role }}</p>
            <p class="founder-line">{{ p.line }}</p>
            <div class="founder-act">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-line" popovertarget="bio-{{ p.slug }}" aria-label="{{ story }}: {{ p.name }}">{{ story }}</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- if loop.first %}
          <ul class="founder-record">
            <li><img src="/assets/logo/partners/logo-ccmb.webp" alt="" width="282" height="345" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span><b>Former Mission Director and Chief Scientist</b>CSIR-Sickle Cell Anaemia Mission, CSIR-CCMB, Hyderabad</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "graduation-cap" %}<span><b>Former Director</b>CDFD, Hyderabad, founding faculty</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "award" %}<span><b>Sir J.C. Bose National Fellow</b>Government of India</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "users" %}<span><b>Fellow of the four Indian national science academies</b>Indian National Science Academy, Indian Academy of Sciences, National Academy of Sciences, India, and National Academy of Medical Sciences; and The World Academy of Sciences</span></li>
          </ul>
          {%- endif %}
          {{- bioPanel(p) }}
        </article>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. The leadership -->
  <section id="leadership" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="leadership-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="leadership-h" class="h2">The leadership. <span class="h-mark">Strategy, finance and operations.</span></h2>
      <ul class="tgrid is-lead mt-10">
        {%- for p in team.leadership %}{{ card(p, "(min-width: 40rem) 11rem, 36vw") }}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. The team, in its groups -->
  <section id="team" class="section" aria-labelledby="team-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <h2 id="team-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-7">The team. <span class="h-mark">Behind our tests and programmes.</span></h2>
        <p class="lead lg:col-span-5">Molecular scientists, laboratory specialists and operations staff, working together in Hyderabad.</p>
      </div>
      {#- One grid, no categories (the user, 5 November 2026); the scientists first, as the data groups them. #}
      <ul class="tgrid is-team mt-12" style="--n: {{ team.team | length }}">
        {%- for g in team.groups %}{% for p in team.team %}{% if p.group == g.id %}{{ card(p, "(min-width: 72rem) 14rem, (min-width: 48rem) 19vw, 5.5rem") }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. The patron and the advisory board -->
  <section id="advisers" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="advisers-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="advisers-h" class="h2 max-w-[60rem]">Patron and scientific advisory board. <span class="h-mark">Guided by leaders in medicine, genetics and public health.</span></h2>
      <ul class="tgrid is-advisers mt-10">
        {%- for p in team.patron %}{{ card(p) }}{% endfor %}
        {%- for p in team.advisers %}{{ card(p) }}{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. The mission -->
  <section id="mission" class="section" aria-labelledby="mission-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="mission-h" class="h2 max-w-[48rem]">Precision genetic healthcare <span class="h-mark">that crosses every barrier.</span></h2>
      <ul class="pillars is-three mt-10">
        {%- for m in [
          { icon: "route", h: "From elite laboratories to the last mile", p: "Molecular diagnosis once needed blood samples, cold chains, DNA extraction and urban genetics institutes. We put same-day confirmation on a room-temperature dried blood spot card any hospital or laboratory can run." },
          { icon: "heart-handshake", h: "Beyond screening: complete care", p: "Screening without follow-up solves nothing. Every patient is linked to clinical care and treatment, and every carrier family to genetic counselling and prenatal diagnosis." },
          { icon: "apple", h: "Genetics, early nutrition and epigenetics", p: "Genes and early nutrition together shape the risk of anaemia, obesity and insulin resistance. Our programmes pair nutritional assessment with genetic screening for preventive care." }
        ] %}
        <li class="pillar">
          <h3>{% icon m.icon %}{{ m.h }}</h3>
          <p class="pillar-body">{{ m.p }}</p>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. The company at a glance -->
  <section id="facts" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="facts-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="facts-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">At a <span class="h-mark">glance.</span></h2>
      <dl class="facts-grid mt-10">
        {%- for row in [
          { icon: "building-2", term: "Legal name", def: site.legalName },
          { icon: "map-pin", term: "Headquarters", def: "Hyderabad, Telangana, India" },
          { icon: "user-round", term: "Founder and CEO", def: "Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak" },
          { icon: "dna", term: "What we do", def: "Develop REASSURED genetic tests for inherited disorders" },
          { icon: "package", term: "Tests", def: "LitLife™-SCA, -SiβThal217, -βThal, -αThal and -SMA; HbD and HbE testing" },
          { icon: "hourglass", term: "In development", def: "A blood coagulation panel; pharmacogenomics" },
          { icon: "badge-check", term: "Approvals", def: "LitLife™-SCA, ICMR approved" },
          { icon: "award", term: "Patents", def: "Granted in India and Japan; published internationally" }
        ] %}
        <div>
          <dt>{% icon row.icon %}<span>{{ row.term }}</span></dt>
          <dd>{{ row.def }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
